Description: Links social science data, such as geocoded survey responses,
    to Earth observation indicators. Retrieves weather and climate data from
    the 'Copernicus' Climate Data Store ('ERA5', Hersbach et al. (2020)
    <doi:10.1002/qj.3803>; 'ERA5-Land', Munoz-Sabater et al. (2021)
    <doi:10.5194/essd-13-4349-2021>) and the German Weather Service ('DWD'),
    and extracts them for each observation's location, date and spatial
    buffer, optionally relative to a historical baseline.
URL: https://github.com/denabel/gxc,
        https://denabel.github.io/gxc_pages/
